<title>USA: Motorola signs two cable modem agreements.</title>
<headline>Motorola signs two cable modem agreements.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said Tuesday its Multimedia Group signed separate contracts to provide CyberSURFR cable modems to Cox Communications Inc and the MediaOne unit of U S West Media Group.</p>
<p>Cox Communications will receive up to 50,000 modems and associated infrastructure equipment during 1997, said Motorola. Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>Motorola added it will ship an unspecified number of CyberSURFR modems to MediaOne in the first quarter of 1997. MediaOne serves 511,000 subscribers in the Atlanta area.</p>
<p>Motorola makes communications products and semiconductors.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
